The work team: a group of agents that carries out a piece of work end to end and reports what it
actually did. Give it the whole goal in detail — it plans its own steps, uses the tools it needs,
and writes its findings back as it goes.

Use it for anything that DOES work: research, drafting, gathering, checking, creating a record,
sending something through a channel. Anything whose point is to reach the user and wait for their
answer is a question, not work, and belongs to the ticket tool instead.
